<title>USA: Ibis Technology Corp Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Ibis Technology Corp Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>DANVERS, MA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   September 30,	     September 30,</p>
<p>			     1996	1995	  1996	 1995</p>
<p>Product Sales  $ 1,210,000 $1,168,000 $ 3,601,000 $2,347,000 Contract and other</p>
<p>   revenue	     44,000    171,000     568,000    750,000</p>
<p>Equipment revenue</p>
<p>			1,600,000	    -   2,840,000	    -</p>
<p> Total revenue    2,854,000  1,339,000   7,009,000  3,097,000</p>
<p>Cost of sales,</p>
<p>excluding</p>
<p>   depreciation   1,911,000    715,000   4,290,000  2,012,000</p>
<p> Depreciation	 329,000    490,000     969,000  1,319,000</p>
<p>Gross profit (loss)</p>
<p>			  614,000    134,000   1,750,000  (234,000)</p>
<p>Operating expenses</p>
<p>			  862,000    665,000   2,549,000  2,400,000</p>
<p>Write-off of the prototype Ibis 1000</p>
<p>   implanter		  -    724,000	     -    724,000</p>
<p>Loss from operations</p>
<p>			(248,000)(1,255,000)   (799,000)(3,358,000)</p>
