<p>Shares used in per share calculation</p>
<p>			5,171,338  3,488,404   4,568,725  3,395,655</p>
<p>Note: (A) Includes $.021 per share for the write-off of the prototype Ibis 1000 implanter.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
